"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[46453],{46453:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/three-body-1.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Three-Body Problem 1: The Three-Body Problem\\"\\n          author=\\"Liu Cixin\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Jaum & Moeum\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2022-02-15\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788954442695\\"\\n          rating=5\\n          tags=\\"sf\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI really enjoyed reading this.  \\nI\'m not a fast reader, but I finished this thick book in no time.  \\n<br>\\nThe collapse of <b>basic physics</b> as we know it and the resulting suicides of scientists in the early part of the book, along with stories jumping between the past and present and a mysterious virtual game world... these elements are scattered at first.  \\nUp to that point, I couldn\'t tell what the main story was.  \\n<br>\\nHowever, as I reached the middle, everything started to connect.  \\nThe concept of the <mark>Three-body problem</mark> was particularly impressive.  \\n<br>\\nI was so curious about what happens next that I immediately started the next book in the series.  \\n"}')}}]);